{"version":1,"name":"SAVE\\SAVGAMJ.DAT","data":"","leads":[{"id":"council-commissions","title":"Council commissions","detail":"Rolf says to read the proclamations at City Hall and ask the clerk about commissions."},{"id":"phlan-training-schools","title":"Training in New Phlan","detail":"Rolf showed the party where adventurers train. Return to the training schools when a character is ready to advance."},{"id":"harbor-trade","title":"The sea lanes","detail":"Rolf says few ships risk the passage and the council wants to reopen it."},{"id":"proclamation-lxiv","title":"Proclamation LXIV","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"proclamation-lxxviii","title":"Proclamation LXXVIII","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"proclamation-cix","title":"Proclamation CIX","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"proclamation-lix","title":"Proclamation LIX","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"passage-sokal","title":"Passage to Sokal Keep","detail":"The harbor master says you can reach the keep by boat."},{"id":"sokal-arrival","title":"Arrival at Sokal Keep","detail":"The party landed on Thorn Island."},{"id":"commission-slums","title":"Clear the Slums - in progress","detail":"Keep clearing encounters in the Slums until the district is secure. 1 encounter cleared.","status":"accepted","clearedEncounters":1},{"id":"commission-sokal","title":"Clear Sokal Keep - turned in","detail":"The council acknowledged the result.","status":"turned-in"},{"id":"commission-records","title":"Recover records of old Phlan - offered","detail":"Search the old city for historical records and bring worthwhile finds to the clerk.","status":"offered"},{"id":"sokal-ferran","title":"Ferran Martinez","detail":"Ferran is bound to guard the keep and a